<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Sept real ind output rises 1.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovak Sept real ind output rises 1.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak real industrial output rose 1.9 percent, year-on-year in September, after a 1.5 year-on-year decrease in August, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Monday.  </p>
<p>  SLOVAK REAL INDUST. OUTPUT Sept'96   Aug'96    Sept'95</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr		+1.9	-1.5	+12.9</p>
<p>  construction Output</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr		+5.8	+2.7	 +0.3</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
